    "html": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif; background: #ffffff; padding: 24px; width: 600px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --color-microsoft-blue: #0067b8;\n      --color-deep-azure: #004a7f;\n      --color-void: #000000;\n      --color-charcoal: #262626;\n      --color-slate: #616161;\n      --color-white: #ffffff;\n      --color-fog: #f2f2f2;\n      --shadow-sm: rgba(0,0,0,0.13) 0px 3px 7px 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.11) 0px 1px 2px 0px;\n      --font-segoe-ui: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif;\n      --spacing-16: 16px;\n      --spacing-24: 24px;\n      --spacing-48: 48px;\n    }\n  </style>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;\">\n    <!-- Card 1: Surface Laptop -->\n    <div style=\"background: var(--color-white); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); border-radius: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n      <div style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c8d8e8 0%, #e0ecf4 100%); overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 120px; height: 80px; background: #b0c8dc; border-radius: 4px; position: relative;\">\n          <div style=\"position: absolute; top: 6px; left: 6px; right: 6px; bottom: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5b9bd5, #2e75b6); border-radius: 2px;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: -10px; right: -10px; height: 6px; background: #a0b8cc; border-radius: 2px;\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 24px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-family: var(--font-segoe-ui); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-void); margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.25;\">Dise\u00f1o elegante y ultradelgado en Surface Laptop 7</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-family: var(--font-segoe-ui); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-charcoal); margin: 0 0 20px 0; line-height: 1.5; flex: 1;\">Surface Laptop: dise\u00f1o premium, alto rendimiento y experiencias Copilot+ con IA, y gran autonom\u00eda de bater\u00eda.</p>\n        <a href=\"#\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: var(--color-microsoft-blue); color: var(--color-white); font-family: var(--font-segoe-ui); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; padding: 10px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 2px; width: fit-content;\">Comprar ahora</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- Card 2: Xbox Game Pass -->\n    <div style=\"background: var(--color-white); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); border-radius: 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n      <div style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%); overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative;\">\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2px; width: 100%; height: 100%;\">\n          <div style=\"background: #2d5a3d;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"background: #3d2d5a;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"background: #5a3d2d;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"background: #5a2d2d;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"background: #2d3d5a;\"></div>\n          <div style=\"background: #3d5a2d;\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 2px;\">\n          <span style=\"font-family: var(--font-segoe-ui); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-white); letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">XBOX GAME PASS</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 24px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-family: var(--font-segoe-ui); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-void); margin: 0 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.25;\">Xbox Game Pass Ultimate</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-family: var(--font-segoe-ui); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--color-charcoal); margin: 0 0 20px 0; line-height: 1.5; flex: 1;\">Juega a t\u00edtulos nuevos desde el d\u00eda de su lanzamiento. Disfruta con tus amigos de cientos de juegos de alta calidad en consola, PC o la nube.</p>\n        <a href=\"#\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: var(--color-microsoft-blue); color: var(--color-white); font-family: var(--font-segoe-ui); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; padding: 10px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 2px; width: fit-content;\">Unirte ahora</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Product Cards Grid",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif; background: #ffffff; padding: 32px 24px; width: 600px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\n  <style>\n    .ms-cat-link { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; }\n    .ms-cat-link:hover .ms-cat-label { color: #004a7f; text-decoration: underline; }\n    .ms-cat-label { font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: #0067b8; text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; }\n  </style>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: flex-start; width: 100%;\">\n    <!-- Surface -->\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"ms-cat-link\">\n      <svg width=\"36\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 36 28\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"34\" height=\"22\" rx=\"1\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"36\" y2=\"26\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"23\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"23\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ms-cat-label\">Comprar port\u00e1tiles Surface</span>\n    </a>\n    <!-- Xbox -->\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"ms-cat-link\">\n      <svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 30\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"14\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <path d=\"M7 8 C10 5, 20 5, 23 8 C18 7, 12 7, 7 8Z\" fill=\"#616161\"/>\n        <path d=\"M4 12 C2 15, 2 20, 5 24 C6 19, 7 14, 4 12Z\" fill=\"#616161\"/>\n        <path d=\"M26 12 C28 15, 28 20, 25 24 C24 19, 23 14, 26 12Z\" fill=\"#616161\"/>\n        <path d=\"M7 25 C10 28, 20 28, 23 25 C18 26, 12 26, 7 25Z\" fill=\"#616161\"/>\n        <ellipse cx=\"10\" cy=\"16\" rx=\"4\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#616161\" opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n        <ellipse cx=\"20\" cy=\"16\" rx=\"4\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"#616161\" opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ms-cat-label\">Comprar consolas y juegos para Xbox</span>\n    </a>\n    <!-- Microsoft 365 -->\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"ms-cat-link\">\n      <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\"/>\n        <rect x=\"15\" y=\"1\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\"/>\n        <rect x=\"1\" y=\"15\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\"/>\n        <rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#616161\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ms-cat-label\">Elige tu Microsoft 365</span>\n    </a>\n    <!-- Accessories -->\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"ms-cat-link\">\n      <svg width=\"34\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 28\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <rect x=\"1\" y=\"5\" width=\"32\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"4\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"9\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"14\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"19\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"4\" y=\"13\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"9\" y=\"13\" width=\"3\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"14\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"3\" rx=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"27\" y=\"1\" width=\"3\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#616161\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"28.5\" cy=\"2.5\" r=\"2\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ms-cat-label\">Comprar Accesorios</span>\n    </a>\n    <!-- Business -->\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"ms-cat-link\">\n      <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <rect x=\"2\" y=\"8\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" rx=\"1\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <path d=\"M9 8 L9 5 C9 4 10 3 11 3 L17 3 C18 3 19 4 19 5 L19 8\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"26\" y2=\"15\" stroke=\"#616161\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span class=\"ms-cat-label\">Comprar para tu empresa</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>",
